Is PEMF therapy okay if one has a seizure disorder? Okay, we were talking about PEMF therapy

00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:20,180
And it's a great therapy, but there are some drawbacks

00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:26,940
So you can't use PEMF therapy if you have an electrical device implanted like

00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,980
pacemaker

00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:33,660
You can't use PEMF therapy if you have a seizure disorder

00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:38,460
Well, you could if you didn't let's say on your feet or

00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:41,460
Or something like that, but you'd have to be really careful

00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:48,820
So there's some things you can't do use PEMF therapy for because it's an electrical therapy

00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:54,420
So whereas the right is light frequencies of PEMF therapy is an electrical therapy

00:00:54,420 --> 00:01:00,340
